1
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:08,800
Remember when I had a monkey?
我之前不是養過猴子？

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,230
What was I thinking?
我在想什麼？

3
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:17,570
Hey,so,what's with the 20 percent tip? Did I do something wrong?
小費怎麼才二十分？ 我做錯事了嗎？

4
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,010
20 percent is a pretty generous tip.
二十分很大方了

5
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,380
You know what's more generous? 50 percent!
你知道幾分更大方？五十分

6
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:28,750
-You know what's even more generous? -I see where you're going.
你知道怎樣更大方？ 我知道你想說什麼了

7
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:30,920
What's up with the greed?
你幹嘛這麼貪？ 

8
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,560
I'm sorry.
好吧，對不起，只是…

9
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:37,320
I have to get new headshots made, and they're really expensive.
我得照新的大頭照，但是好貴 

10
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,190
I'm down to,like,three.
我只剩三張了

11
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:43,500
Actually,two, because one of them I blackened some teeth.
其實是兩張，有一張的牙齒 被我塗黑…

12
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,430
Why'd I do that?
我秀逗啊

13
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:49,330
Isn't there something you can do to earn extra money?
你不能設法多賺一點嗎？ 

14
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,440
Can't you pick up an extra shift here?
例如在這裡多輪一班

15
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:55,840
Or,you know,I used to beg for money.
或是我以前當過乞丐

16
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:00,920
It helps if you've got a little of this going on.
如果能這樣更有用

17
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,390
Wow! I still have it.
我現在還會

18
00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:07,790
Don't you have an audition today? Maybe you'll get that job.
等等，你今天不是有試鏡？ 也許你會入選

20
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:12,360
Wait a minute.
等等

21
00:01:12,570 --> 00:01:15,470
I used to get medical experiments done on me.
我以前常參加醫學實驗

22
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,600
Finally,an explanation.
難怪變成這樣

23
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:22,800
I used to get paid for all kinds of medical stuff.
不是，我以前常靠這個賺錢 記得嗎？

24
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:27,280
Let's see... Well,I don't want to donate sperm again.
我想想，我不想再捐精了 

25
00:01:27,550 --> 00:01:30,110
I really prefer doing that at the home office.
那種事在家做比較好

26
00:01:30,650 --> 00:01:34,610
Maybe they want some of my blood or spit or something,huh?
也許醫院會要我的血或口水

27
00:01:35,090 --> 00:01:36,180
-Joey? -Yeah.
喬伊？ 怎樣？

28
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:39,830
What did I tell you about talking while working?
我說工作時跟朋友聊天會怎樣

29
00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:41,120
Do it?
幹得好？

30
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:47,390
That guy's been waiting 10 minutes. He's complained about you three times.
那個人等咖啡等了10分鐘 他抱怨了你三次

31
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,130
Now,where was l?
我講到哪裡？

32
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,730
The One With Unagi
本集播出：「鰻魚力量」

00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,730
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

33
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,740
What are you up to?
你們在忙什麼？

34
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:36,080
We went to a self-defense class today.
我們今天去學防身術

35
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:39,980
Kicking a guy in the crotch all morning really takes it out of you.
對，踢了一早上的鼠蹊部 什麼鳥氣都沒了

36
00:02:40,490 --> 00:02:42,290
Takes it out of you?
那是你們

37
00:02:43,990 --> 00:02:46,290
Now we can kick anybody's ass.
現在我們誰都能修理 

38
00:02:46,530 --> 00:02:48,760
After one class? I don't think so.
才一堂課？不會吧

39
00:02:49,330 --> 00:02:51,590
You want to see me self-defend myself?
你想看我自衛嗎？

40
00:02:51,830 --> 00:02:53,800
Pretend you're a predator.
去假裝你是性侵犯

41
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,200
Go on,I dare you!
有種就去

42
00:02:56,770 --> 00:03:00,640
Of course you can defend yourself from an attack you know is coming.
你當然可以抵擋已知的攻擊

43
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,670
That's not enough.
但那樣還不夠

44
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:06,110
Look,I studied karate for a long time.
我學了很久的空手道

45
00:03:07,620 --> 00:03:10,480
And there's a concept you should be familiar with.
有個概念你們一定要瞭解 

46
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:14,950
It's what the Japanese call unagi.
日文叫做unagi

47
00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:18,690
Isn't that a kind of sushi?
那不是一種壽司嗎？

48
00:03:19,790 --> 00:03:20,890
No,it's a concept.
那是一種概念 

49
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:24,000
Yeah,it is. It's freshwater eel.
是壽司沒錯，那是鰻魚

50
00:03:24,670 --> 00:03:26,070
Maybe it means that too.
或許是同一個字…

51
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:29,400
I would kill for a salmon-skin roll right now.
我現在好想吃鮭魚握壽司

52
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,770
Fine,get attacked. I don't even care.
好，被攻擊活該，我不在乎

53
00:03:34,010 --> 00:03:37,810
Come on,Ross,we're sorry. Please tell us what it is.
羅斯，對不起，快告訴我們

54
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:44,810
Unagi is a state of total awareness.
Unagi是一種全知的境界

55
00:03:45,250 --> 00:03:47,810
Only by achieving true unagi...
只有達到真正的unagi 

56
00:03:48,090 --> 00:03:52,320
can you be prepared for any danger that may befall you.
才能應付任何可能的危險

57
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:56,030
In case someone's trying to steal your bamboo sleeping mat...
你是說有人要偷你的竹蓆 

58
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:58,130
or your kettle of fish?
或魚壺的時候嗎？

59
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:06,500
It's one thing being prepared for an attack against each other.
我是說應付彼此攻擊是一回事

60
00:04:06,770 --> 00:04:11,510
Whole other story being prepared for an attack. I don't know.. Surprise!
應付偷襲又是另一回事

61
00:04:19,350 --> 00:04:20,840
You knew that was coming...
好，這次你們料到了 

62
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:25,060
but that doesn't mean you have unagi.
但不表示你們有unagi

63
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:32,370
If we made reservations, we could have unagi in a half-hour.
知道嗎？如果我們現在訂位 半小時後就能吃到鰻魚

64
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:37,130
-Is Monica here? -No.
摩妮卡在嗎？ 不在

65
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:40,800
I need help. I don't know what to get for Valentine's Day.
幫個忙 我不知道該送什麼情人節禮物

66
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:45,810
Valentine's Day was two weeks ago, so I wouldn't get her a calendar.
情人節已經過兩星期了 我不會送她日曆

67
00:04:46,910 --> 00:04:50,080
She was working, so we're celebrating tonight.
她那天要上班，我們改今天過

68
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:54,410
Why don't you book a day for both of you at those romantic spas?
去幫你們一起訂個SPA嘛

69
00:04:54,660 --> 00:04:56,990
That's actually a good idea.
喬伊，這個主意很棒

70
00:04:57,260 --> 00:05:00,060
And,of course,crotchless panties.
還有胯下開洞的內褲

71
00:05:02,930 --> 00:05:05,560
As appealing as that sounds to her boyfriend...
雖然她的男朋友覺得很誘人… 

72
00:05:06,030 --> 00:05:07,830
and her brother...
她哥哥也是

73
00:05:11,210 --> 00:05:14,070
We promised to make each other gifts this year.
但我們說好今年要自己做禮物

74
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:15,610
-I love that. -You guys!
我喜歡 真好

75
00:05:16,010 --> 00:05:18,170
You can't make crotchless panties?
你不會做開洞的內褲？

76
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:21,610
You take scissors and cut..
拿一把剪刀給它剪… 

77
00:05:21,850 --> 00:05:22,870
Okay,okay,okay.
好好好

78
00:05:24,190 --> 00:05:26,180
Making things sounds so much fun.
做禮物，聽起來好好玩

79
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:29,620
I thought so too,until I papier-mached one of my eyes shut.
我也這麼認為 直到我的眼睛糊到紙黏土

80
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:32,520
I love papier-mache! What did you make?
我喜歡紙黏土，你做了什麼？

81
00:05:32,790 --> 00:05:34,630
I made a flar-lar-lar.
我做了@#% ！

82
00:05:36,430 --> 00:05:37,760
-What is that? -Nothing!
那是什麼？ 什麼也不是

83
00:05:40,130 --> 00:05:41,400
So,what are you gonna do?
你要怎麼辦？

84
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:44,370
Have you made anything I can take credit for?
你們有沒有做什麼能借給我用

85
00:05:44,610 --> 00:05:48,100
I have,I have! I started making little sock bunnies!
我有！我有！我做了襪子兔 

86
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:50,240
Oh,for crying out loud!
了不起吧

87
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:54,610
Wait a minute. That is my sock!
等等，那是我的襪子

88
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,950
Now it's your little bunny friend.
現在它是你的兔兔朋友

89
00:06:08,730 --> 00:06:09,960
Okay...
好

90
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:17,240
This actually is a flar-lar-lar.
這是一個@#% ！

91
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:23,870
Can I ask about the Valentine's Day gifts?
我能不能問你情人節禮物的事 

92
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:26,600
-Yeah. -Do we have to make the entire thing?
可以啊 全都要自己做嗎？ 

93
00:06:27,250 --> 00:06:29,440
Yes. Did you forget to make yours?
當然，你忘了做嗎？

94
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,410
Of course not.
當然沒有

95
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:37,580
I just have to go to the place where I made it and pick it up.
我只是得去做的地方拿回來 好

96
00:06:38,590 --> 00:06:42,030
I can't wait. It'll be the best Valentine's Day ever!
我好期待 這會是最棒的情人節

97
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:47,360
I can't believe it! Make the presents!
我居然忘了，要做禮物

98
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:51,970
-What? -Just so excited to make the presents!
什麼？ 要做禮物好興奮喔

99
00:06:56,649 --> 00:06:57,638
真是的

100
00:07:00,350 --> 00:07:02,510
Hi,I'm Joey Tribbiani.
你好，我是喬伊崔比亞尼 

101
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:05,620
With all due respect, I'd like to donate some fluids.
我想捐贈一些體液

102
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:12,020
We're at the end of a research cycle and not looking for applicants now.
我們的研究剛告一段落 目前沒有在找人

103
00:07:12,230 --> 00:07:14,890
That's too bad. I've been saving up.
真可惜，我存了一陣子

104
00:07:18,970 --> 00:07:21,870
You sure there's no studies I can participate in?
真的沒有我能參加的研究？

105
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:25,230
-Here's a schedule. -Thanks.
這是接下來的一覽表 謝謝

106
00:07:26,410 --> 00:07:27,700
This one starts now.
這個已經開始了

107
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:32,070
Only identical twins are eligible. It's a twin study.
沒錯，但只限雙胞胎 那是雙胞胎研究

108
00:07:32,410 --> 00:07:33,880
But it's $2000!
但是有2千塊錢 

109
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,150
Sorry.
抱歉

110
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:39,410
And this?
那...

111
00:07:39,890 --> 00:07:44,850
"Testing the Effects of Joey Tribbiani on Attractive Nurse Receptionist."
喬伊崔比亞尼 對美女接待的影響力實驗呢？

112
00:07:46,330 --> 00:07:49,730
Results are back on that one. They're not good.
結果已經出來了，不太理想

113
00:07:54,170 --> 00:07:56,000
-That was good. -Yeah.

114
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:58,600
Danger! Danger!
危險！危險

115
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:05,040
What the hell was that?
你搞什麼啊？ 

116
00:08:05,380 --> 00:08:08,710
A lesson in the importance of unagi.
讓你們認識unagi的重要

117
00:08:12,050 --> 00:08:13,580
You're a freak!
你變態

118
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,850
Perhaps.
或許吧

119
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:18,650
Now I'm curious.
我很好奇

120
00:08:18,830 --> 00:08:23,920
At what point during those girlish screams would you have kicked my ass?
你們那樣哀哀叫 什麼時候才要修理我？

121
00:08:26,430 --> 00:08:29,130
All right, so we weren't prepared!
好吧，我們沒有準備

122
00:08:30,610 --> 00:08:34,370
I'm sorry I had to take such drastic measures to make my point.
抱歉用這種方法傳達我的重點 

123
00:08:34,610 --> 00:08:36,440
I just want you to be safe.
我是為你們的安全著想

124
00:08:38,210 --> 00:08:39,470
Danger!
危險！

125
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,480
Ah-ha!

126
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:47,380
Unagi!
Unagi

127
00:08:51,764 --> 00:08:53,857
「選角經紀公司」

128
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:56,390
2000 bucks is a lot of money.
2千塊好多 

129
00:08:56,830 --> 00:08:58,260
I wish I had a twin.
真想有個雙胞胎兄弟

130
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:01,830
Where could I find someone...
哪裡才有...

131
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:04,800
who looks exactly like me?
跟我長得一樣的人？

132
00:09:26,630 --> 00:09:28,190
Chandler.
錢德

133
00:09:29,830 --> 00:09:32,200
I sensed it was you.
我感覺到是你

134
00:09:34,100 --> 00:09:35,430
What?
什麼？

135
00:09:36,370 --> 00:09:37,670
Unagi.
Unagi

136
00:09:38,710 --> 00:09:40,260
I'm always aware.
我永遠全知

137
00:09:40,470 --> 00:09:43,470
Are you aware that unagi is an eel?
你知道unagi是鰻魚嗎？

138
00:09:45,380 --> 00:09:48,110
-What's up? -I can't figure out what to make Monica.
什麼事？ 我不知道該做什麼禮物

139
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,680
Why don't you make her one of your little jokes?
你可以講個笑話

140
00:09:50,950 --> 00:09:54,850
I'm going crazy. Do you have anything homemade?
我快急死了，好嗎？ 你有沒有狀似自製的東西？

141
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:58,220
You know what? She'd love this.
這個她一定會喜歡

142
00:09:58,460 --> 00:10:01,950
It's a replica of Apollo 8. I made it in the sixth grade.
這是阿波羅八號的模型 我六年級做的

143
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:07,460
I could use that. I could say, "Your love sends me to the moon."
這個可以 我可以說你的愛讓我飛上月亮

144
00:10:07,670 --> 00:10:10,570
Except Apollo 8 didn't actually land on the moon.
可是阿波羅八號沒有登陸月球

145
00:10:10,810 --> 00:10:15,870
You can say, "Your love lets me orbit the moon twice and return safely."
不過你可以寫你的愛 讓我繞行月球兩圈後順利返航

146
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,640
I can't give this to her.
我不能送這個 為什麼？

147
00:10:19,850 --> 00:10:22,840
-Why not? -It says "Captain Ross" on the side.
因為旁邊寫著「羅斯隊長」 

148
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:27,710
And it says "I hate Monica" on the bottom.
底下寫著「我討厭摩妮卡」

149
00:10:31,830 --> 00:10:33,160
Danger!
危險！

150
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:43,660
Salmon-skin roll.
鮭魚握壽司

151
00:10:47,947 --> 00:10:49,244
好…

152
00:11:04,590 --> 00:11:06,360
Yes,honey, I made it myself.
沒錯，這是我自己做的

153
00:11:20,540 --> 00:11:22,570
I can't do it. I can't do it.
我剪不下去，我剪不下去

154
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:29,440
A mixed tape! A mixed tape!
自己錄的合輯

155
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:33,710
Hi! Ready to exchange gifts?
可以交換禮物了嗎？ 

156
00:11:33,950 --> 00:11:36,950
-Sure. You go first. -Okay,come here.
當然，你先 好，過來 

157
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:40,990
Okay, it's not wrapped because I just finished it.
好 我沒有包裝，因為我剛完成 好

159
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:45,560
But I made you a tape of what I think are all romantic songs.
我錄了一捲浪漫情歌給你

160
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:48,930
What a great gift!
好棒的禮物

161
00:11:51,570 --> 00:11:54,010
Is "The Way You Look Tonight" on it?
有「你今晚的模樣」嗎？

162
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:58,670
We'll have to listen and see.
聽了就知道

163
00:11:59,580 --> 00:12:02,340
Oh,I love it! Thank you so much.
我好喜歡喔，謝謝你 不客氣

164
00:12:04,420 --> 00:12:05,980
You ready to open yours?
你要拆了嗎？ 要

165
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,860
It's a sock bunny.
是襪子兔

166
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,770
Remember how I call you bunny?
對，我不是有叫你小兔兔？ 

167
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:25,100
Not really.
有嗎？

168
00:12:26,610 --> 00:12:29,770
I did one time. And I want to start doing it more.
我叫過一次，以後我想多叫

169
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:33,110
-That's what this is about. -I see.
所以做了襪子兔 我懂了

170
00:12:33,810 --> 00:12:35,680
Phoebe makes sock bunnies.
菲比也有做襪子兔

171
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:39,510
No,she doesn't. What she makes,they're sock rabbits.
不，沒有 菲比做的是襪子兔子

172
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:42,310
They're completely different. Okay,okay.
完全不一樣…好吧

173
00:12:42,690 --> 00:12:44,350
I didn't make it!
這不是我做的

174
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:48,360
I forgot about tonight and that we're supposed to make the presents.
我完全忘了今晚和做禮物的事

175
00:12:48,730 --> 00:12:49,860
It's okay.
沒關係，我… 

176
00:12:50,300 --> 00:12:51,390
No,it's not okay.
不，當然有關係

177
00:12:51,700 --> 00:12:53,290
You're so incredible.
你那麼…你那麼用心 

178
00:12:53,570 --> 00:12:57,400
You went through all this time and effort to make this tape.
花那麼多心血錄情歌給我

179
00:12:59,570 --> 00:13:01,470
I'll make this up to you. I will.
我要補償你，我一定會的

180
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:06,240
I am going to cook you anything you want in here.
我會下廚房煮你想吃的菜 

181
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:10,750
And I'm going to do anything you want in there.
進臥房玩你想玩的花樣

182
00:13:12,820 --> 00:13:15,980
Well, I did put a lot of thought into the tape.
我的確花了很多心血

183
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:31,000
You are way too young to have seen that.
你還小，不該看的

184
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,630
Your birthday's in a month and a half.
再1個半月就是你的生日 

185
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:38,410
What if I forget to get you a present for that too?
要是我又忘記準備禮物呢？

186
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:42,450
You are totally and completely 100 percent forgiven.
我百分之百完全原諒你

187
00:13:43,820 --> 00:13:45,180
We've got to wash that.
那個得拿去洗 沒錯

188
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:53,320
Remember that jacket you loved that was too expensive?
你不是看上一件外套 又嫌它太貴？

189
00:13:53,590 --> 00:13:55,590
You have done enough.
你對我已經夠好了

190
00:13:56,460 --> 00:13:58,290
I'll wake up early and get it.
我要一早跑去買來送你

191
00:13:58,500 --> 00:14:00,660
No,you don't.. Get it in black,not brown.
你不必… 買黑色，別買咖啡色

192
00:14:03,500 --> 00:14:05,030
Your cake is ready.
你的蛋糕好了

193
00:14:09,010 --> 00:14:12,950
It's like that old saying, "Have sex, eat some cake."
俗話說得好 做做愛，吃吃蛋糕

194
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:18,680
Hey,Mon. Hey,Chan. Just getting a soda.
小摩，老錢，我來拿汽水

195
00:14:23,890 --> 00:14:25,450
Who the hell are you?
你是誰？ 

196
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:27,720
I'm Joey.
喬伊啊

197
00:14:28,730 --> 00:14:30,790
How are you doing?
你好嗎？

198
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:35,030
No! No! No! No! No!
錯錯錯錯錯！

199
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,030
How you doing?
是你好嗎

200
00:14:38,710 --> 00:14:42,340
How you doing? Damn it, Carl! Go wait in the hall.
你好嗎…真是的！去走廊等我

201
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:50,220
I've got to apologize on behalf of Carl.
我代替卡爾道歉 

202
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:52,510
Who the hell is Carl?
卡爾是誰？

203
00:14:53,250 --> 00:14:54,520
Did I not mention?
我沒說嗎？

204
00:14:55,760 --> 00:15:00,890
Carl is a guy I hired to be my twin for a medical research project.
我找卡爾來演我的雙胞胎兄弟 好參加醫學研究

205
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:07,830
Sometimes the good ideas are right in front of you.
有時妙計就在眼前，是吧？

206
00:15:08,770 --> 00:15:13,170
It sounds crazy, but it might work. The only problem is Carl's acting...
我知道很扯，但搞不好會成功 唯一的問題是卡爾的演技…

207
00:15:13,410 --> 00:15:15,240
The only problem?
唯一的問題？

208
00:15:16,410 --> 00:15:20,240
He's the reason I didn't get that big commercial a couple of years ago.
對，他害我兩年前 痛失那支大廣告，記得嗎？

209
00:15:20,450 --> 00:15:22,710
We were supposed to be brothers, but he messed up.
我們演兄弟，他卻搞砸了

210
00:15:24,050 --> 00:15:26,080
Can I get a piece of that cake?
我可以吃一小塊蛋糕嗎？

211
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:29,250
Pizza! We like pizza! Get out!
披薩，我們愛吃披薩 滾出去

212
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,430
-Pat Sajak? -Yep.
派特賽賈克？ 可以

213
00:15:39,700 --> 00:15:41,630
-Alex Trebek? -Of course.
亞歷崔貝克？ 當然

214
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:44,240
-Chuck Woolery? -Definitely.
恰克烏勒利？ 絕對行

215
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:49,470
You will not find a single game-show host whose ass I cannot kick.
所有的綜藝節目主持人 我都能修理

216
00:15:58,990 --> 00:16:01,280
-Say it! -Say we are unagi!
說 說我們是unagi

217
00:16:02,820 --> 00:16:05,950
It's not something you are, it's something you have.
不是是不是，而是有沒有

218
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:07,990
Say it!
快說

219
00:16:08,230 --> 00:16:09,920
I could easily get out of this...
我可以輕易掙脫 

220
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:14,070
but there's a chance you could get very, very hurt!
但你們可能會死得很慘

221
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:30,980
Carl,we're next. Now remember, what is this not gonna be?
接著就是我們 記住，這次不能怎樣？

222
00:16:31,250 --> 00:16:34,120
-Another Minute Maid fiasco. -That's right.
重蹈那次廣告的覆轍 沒錯

223
00:16:34,290 --> 00:16:35,650
And what are you not gonna do?
你不能怎樣？

224
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:39,490
-I'm not gonna talk because.. -Damn it,Carl!
我不能講話，因為… 你還講

225
00:16:40,766 --> 00:16:42,233
惦惦

226
00:16:43,930 --> 00:16:45,760
Can I have the next one,please?
下一組的資料…

227
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:47,260
Thank you.
謝謝

228
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:49,500
Joey and Tony Tribbiani.
喬伊和湯尼崔比亞尼 

229
00:16:49,940 --> 00:16:51,200
That's us.
我們就是

230
00:16:51,470 --> 00:16:54,770
But this is a study for identical twins.
這是雙胞胎的研究 

231
00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:57,880
That's right. $2000.
沒錯，2千大洋

232
00:16:59,050 --> 00:17:00,840
But you're not identical twins.
但你們不是雙胞胎

233
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:05,350
Damn it, Carl!
都是你啦

234
00:17:11,890 --> 00:17:13,880
Oh, my good God.
我的天哪

235
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:19,900
Continuing the countdown of your favorite meals.
你最愛吃的食物倒數 

236
00:17:20,230 --> 00:17:23,070
Tonight, number three:
今晚，第三名

237
00:17:23,570 --> 00:17:26,840
Macaroni and cheese with cut-up hot dogs.
起司通心粉加切丁的熱狗

238
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:32,140
Look,you have done enough. You have to stop this now.
你對我夠好了，別再費心了

239
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:34,370
I will,but not tonight.
我會的，但不是今晚

240
00:17:34,580 --> 00:17:38,710
For dinner music, I thought we could listen to that tape that you made me.
晚餐音樂就來聽你錄的帶子

241
00:17:39,150 --> 00:17:40,710
Oh, the mixed tape.
那卷合輯

242
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:52,100
"The Way You Look Tonight" is on here.
剛好就是「你今晚的模樣」 

243
00:17:52,370 --> 00:17:53,590
Dance with me.
陪我跳舞

244
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:15,350
You are just the sweetest.
你最好最好了

245
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:22,690
I love the way you look every night, Chandler.
你每晚的模樣我都愛，錢德

246
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:29,590
That's why I made you this tape.
所以我錄這卷帶子給你 

247
00:18:29,870 --> 00:18:34,100
Happy birthday! Love,Janice!
生日快樂，愛你的珍妮絲

248
00:18:39,810 --> 00:18:41,470
No,you're the sweetest.
不，你最好最好了

249
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:50,580
Okay, ladies, that ends today's class.
好，今天的課到此為止 

250
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:52,380
Remember,be safe out there.
記住，一定要平安

251
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:01,130
-Great class. -Thanks.
你教得真好 謝謝

252
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:03,270
I was watching.
我看得很仔細

253
00:19:06,410 --> 00:19:09,430
A couple of questions:
不過我有一些問題

254
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,340
You know that last move...
剛才最後...

255
00:19:11,610 --> 00:19:14,740
where that woman tripped you and pinned you to the floor?
那個女人把你絆倒 壓在地上

256
00:19:14,980 --> 00:19:16,280
What would you do next?
你接下來會怎麼做？

257
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:18,920
She'd take the keys and jam them in your..
她會拿鑰匙來刺… 

258
00:19:19,150 --> 00:19:22,120
No,no. What would you do next?
不是，是你會怎麼做？

259
00:19:22,420 --> 00:19:25,290
-Who,me,the attacker? -Yes,that's right.
你是說攻擊者？ 是的

260
00:19:26,490 --> 00:19:27,480
Why?
幹嘛？ 

261
00:19:27,690 --> 00:19:31,190
I tried attacking two women. Did not work.
我想偷襲兩個女人，卻沒成功

262
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:32,520
What?
什麼？ 

263
00:19:32,770 --> 00:19:35,000
No,it's okay. They're my friends.
沒關係，她們是我的朋友

264
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:38,600
In fact,I was married to one of them.
我還跟其中一個結過婚

265
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:42,110
You attacked your ex-wife?
你偷襲你的前妻？

266
00:19:42,310 --> 00:19:44,170
Oh,no. No,no.
不是…

267
00:19:44,410 --> 00:19:46,070
I tried.
我想偷襲她

268
00:19:47,610 --> 00:19:51,280
But I couldn't. That's why I'm here.
卻打不過她，所以才來找你

269
00:19:51,590 --> 00:19:54,110
Maybe we could attack them together!
或許我們可以一起對付她們

270
00:19:56,490 --> 00:19:58,080
That's a no.
你不要

271
00:19:59,660 --> 00:20:03,320
I am so,so,so,so sorry.
非常非常非常對不起

272
00:20:08,270 --> 00:20:11,100
And I will cook anything you want in here...
我會下廚房煮你想吃的菜 

273
00:20:11,340 --> 00:20:14,870
and do anything you want in there.
進臥房玩你想玩的花樣

274
00:20:16,380 --> 00:20:19,440
Yeah,you will! And are you kidding me?
你當然得煮，你想得美喔

275
00:20:22,050 --> 00:20:24,850
Come on,Monica, it's our Valentine's Day.
別這樣，這是我們的情人節 

276
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:27,180
Please,please,please,please?
拜託啦？

277
00:20:29,560 --> 00:20:30,550
Okay.
好吧

278
00:20:36,568 --> 00:20:46,005
我有趣的情人 甜蜜逗趣的情人

279
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:49,870
-So are we going in there? -I am!
要進房間了嗎？ 我要

280
00:20:53,352 --> 00:20:57,288
你的表情如此有趣

281
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:06,990
Nowhere to run.
你們逃不掉了

282
00:21:09,260 --> 00:21:11,960
I don't like sitting up here. I'm gonna go over..
我不喜歡坐這裡，我要過去…

283
00:21:12,170 --> 00:21:13,690
No,they got here first.
是他們先來的

284
00:21:23,140 --> 00:21:25,370
-Why is Ross doing that? -Danger!
羅斯在幹嘛？ 危險！ 

285
00:21:25,610 --> 00:21:30,140
Oh,my God! Why is he jumping on those women?
天哪 他幹嘛撲向那兩個女人？

287
00:21:31,690 --> 00:21:33,710
We should help them.
我們應該去幫她們

288
00:21:33,990 --> 00:21:37,050
I don't think they need any help.
我看她們不需要幫忙

289
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


290
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

